      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The chosen approach is [one bundle per run per person rather than one message per skill](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2), with the bundle's close condition fixed as [the run closing, late skills waiting for the next run rather than sending on their own](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_4).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The rejected alternative stays expandable: [per-skill delivery with client-side collapsing, which moves the ordering problem onto the reader](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The choice was contested in the record itself — [a pushback on the batching window, held against](narr:Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3) — so the dissent is retrievable beside the verdict.""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """The parent frame states the aim as [shielding recipients from fragmentation](narr:Narrative_ReactionDeliveryBundling).""" ]
      [ narr:op "kept" ; narr:text """A newer child opens a distinct question — [recurring reaction summaries scheduled across multi-day windows alongside per-run bundles](narr:Position_WeeklyReactionRollUpCadence) — extending the region from one decision point toward a cadence dimension.""" ]
